{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03013","headline":"荆州作二首 一 · 张九龄","name":"荆州作二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先达志其大，求意不约文。\n士伸在知己，已况仕於君。\n微诚夙所尚，细故不足云。\n时来忽易失，事往良难分。\n顾念凡近姿，焉欲殊常勳。\n亦以行则是，岂必素有闻。\n千虑且犹失，万绪何其纷。\n进士苟非党，免相安得羣。\n衆口金可铄，孤心丝共棼。\n意忠仗朋信，语勇同败军。\n古剑徒有气，幽兰秪自薰。\n高秩向所忝，於义如浮云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}